.TH SDL_CommonEvent 3type "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 DATATYPES"
.SH NAME
SDL_CommonEvent \- Fields shared by every event (event.common.*)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_events.h>
.PP
.BI "typedef struct SDL_CommonEvent
.BI "{
.BI "    Uint32 type;        /**< Event type, shared with all events, Uint32 to cover user events which are not in the SDL_EventType enumeration */
.BI "    Uint32 reserved;
.BI "    Uint64 timestamp;   /**< In nanoseconds, populated using SDL_GetTicksNS() */
.BI "} SDL_CommonEvent;
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
All the individual structs that comprise the
.BR SDL_Event
union start with these same fields, so you can access them from any struct directly\[char46]
.PP
Event types that don\(aqt have further data in a specific struct will still have valid CommonEvent data, accessible via the event\[char46]common field\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This struct is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

